WEBVTT

00:30:28.060 --> 00:30:33.220
they executed AI algorithms
for routing food to your home,

00:30:33.244 --> 00:30:36.234
they competed on finding lower-cost people

00:30:36.258 --> 00:30:40.569
who could work on delivering
on lower-cost mopeds

00:30:40.593 --> 00:30:44.997
and high-tech, low-tech solutions,
whatever it takes.

00:30:45.021 --> 00:30:51.149
An American professor was in China
about four months ago.

00:30:51.173 --> 00:30:54.412
She got stuck in Beijing traffic,
which is a big problem,

00:30:54.436 --> 00:30:56.403
stuck for an hour,

00:30:56.427 --> 00:31:00.490
and she was going to miss dinner
and have to go to the evening meeting.